        },
        "description": "How the software around X9.150 learns a QR Code was paid.\n\nDeduplicate by eventId (delivery is at-least-once) and persist nextCursor only AFTER the events are stored. Exactly one system should poll a deployment.\n\npayment.sent means a payer REPORTED a transaction - it does not mean paid. Only payment.cleared says funds arrived."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const page = pm.response.json();",
              "if (page.nextCursor) { pm.collectionVariables.set('eventCursor', page.nextCursor); }",
              "console.log('events:', (page.events || []).map(e => e.type + ' ' + e.qrCodeId).join(', ') || '(none)');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Notification - pre-payment (payer side)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{x9qrcode_host}}/api/v1/payment-notification/pre-payment",
          "host": [
            "{{x9qrcode_host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "payment-notification",
            "pre-payment"
          ]
        },
        "description": "PAYER SIDE. Announce a payment to the payee and wait for permission, then pay exactly what was announced.\n\nMust NOT carry a transactionId: the payee infers the phase from its absence, so one here reads as a payment already made and the QR Code is never reserved.\n\n200 with accepted=false is a REFUSAL, not an error. 502 means the payee was unreachable and nothing was delivered - retry that one.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"endpoint\": \"{{payeeNotificationEndpoint}}\",\n  \"notification\": {\n    \"payment\": {\n      \"qrcodeId\": \"{{id}}\",\n      \"amount\": 22500,\n      \"currency\": \"USDC\",\n      \"network\": \"Solana\"\n    },\n    \"payer\": {\n      \"info\": \"payer@example.com\"\n    },\n    \"blockchain\": {\n      \"action\": \"PAYMENT_INITIATED\",\n      \"from\": \"{{payerWallet}}\",\n      \"to\": \"{{payeeWallet}}\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 - the payee answered', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('pay only if accepted', () => pm.expect(r.accepted).to.be.true);",
              "if (!r.accepted) { console.log('payee refused:', r.statusCode, r.body); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
