        "description": "PAYER SIDE. Report the payment that was made, carrying its reference - the on-chain hash, or the End-to-End ID for an ISO 20022 rail.\n\nMUST carry a transactionId. This does NOT clear the QR Code: X9.150 never sees the funds, so the QR Code stays PAYMENT_INITIATED until whoever received them says otherwise.\n\nDelivery is the caller's to retry: a 502 means hold the report and send it later.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"endpoint\": \"{{payeeNotificationEndpoint}}\",\n  \"notification\": {\n    \"payment\": {\n      \"qrcodeId\": \"{{id}}\",\n      \"amount\": 22500,\n      \"currency\": \"USDC\",\n      \"network\": \"Solana\",\n      \"transactionId\": \"{{transactionId}}\"\n    },\n    \"payer\": {\n      \"info\": \"payer@example.com\"\n    },\n    \"blockchain\": {\n      \"action\": \"SENT\",\n      \"from\": \"{{payerWallet}}\",\n      \"to\": \"{{payeeWallet}}\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
